{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39753","headline":"奉和翁文尧员外文秀光贤昼锦之什 一 · 黄滔","name":"奉和翁文尧员外文秀光贤昼锦之什 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乡名里号一朝新，乃觉台恩重万钧。\n建水闽山无故事，长卿严助是前身。\n清泉引入旁添润，嘉树移来别带春。\n莫凭栏干剩留驻，内庭虚位待才臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39753.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39753","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}